# Files not uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Vercel runs `npm install` and `npm run build` on its own machines, so only the
# sources the build actually reads need to travel. Everything below is either
# rebuilt there, irrelevant to the build, or must never leave this machine.
#
# Note: public/img/ is deliberately NOT listed. Those garment photographs are
# the site's product imagery and must ship with the build.

# Rebuilt on Vercel
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
.cache/

# Never upload
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Version control and local tooling
.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# Docs and scratch — not read by the build
README.md
CLAUDE.md
*.log
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
CLAUDE.md
.claude